{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Carnival",
    "steam_appid": 2928770,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928770/extras/75a19b5f52072a45589d12accdb5f52a.avif?t=1754826257\" width=600 height=140 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928770/extras/3ba089264fc9acfa4a265724a3e56b31.poster.avif?t=1754826257\" width=600 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928770/extras/3ba089264fc9acfa4a265724a3e56b31.webm?t=1754826257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928770/extras/3ba089264fc9acfa4a265724a3e56b31.mp4?t=1754826257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After agreeing to take on what seems like a mundane story about the unique city and its planned road bridge, journalist James Maynard finds himself uncovering a disturbing underbelly to the local customs, and a hideous core to the notion of Venetian pride.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not even the might of Mussolini can truly kill the Carnival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928770/extras/ce5a9648795dc83fc51ea9c2fcbcf96d.avif?t=1754826257\" width=600 height=113 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carnival is an atmospheric folk horror point-&amp;-click set in a time of European upheaval, where the past and the future collide. The protagonist must struggle with narcolepsy and its effect on both his memory and perception of the increasingly twisted reality around him. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928770/extras/19aba58f2bba7acf669bfe7aeda460af.avif?t=1754826257\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features atmospheric low-resolution pixel art graphics, multiple locations drawn from Venice itself, and developing relationships with NPCs, allowing the player to influence events in the game and achieve multiple different endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928770/extras/9a8b13573f62371b5d9fab6cbb718614.avif?t=1754826257\" width=600 height=296 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by Beyond Booleans, creator of Abscission, winner of three AGS awards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928770/extras/815ec681c52c8676f3ba662d8f2a031f.avif?t=1754826257\" width=600 height=174 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928770/extras/75a19b5f52072a45589d12accdb5f52a.avif?t=1754826257\" width=600 height=140 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928770/extras/3ba089264fc9acfa4a265724a3e56b31.poster.avif?t=1754826257\" width=600 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928770/extras/3ba089264fc9acfa4a265724a3e56b31.webm?t=1754826257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928770/extras/3ba089264fc9acfa4a265724a3e56b31.mp4?t=1754826257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After agreeing to take on what seems like a mundane story about the unique city and its planned road bridge, journalist James Maynard finds himself uncovering a disturbing underbelly to the local customs, and a hideous core to the notion of Venetian pride.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not even the might of Mussolini can truly kill the Carnival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928770/extras/ce5a9648795dc83fc51ea9c2fcbcf96d.avif?t=1754826257\" width=600 height=113 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carnival is an atmospheric folk horror point-&amp;-click set in a time of European upheaval, where the past and the future collide. The protagonist must struggle with narcolepsy and its effect on both his memory and perception of the increasingly twisted reality around him. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928770/extras/19aba58f2bba7acf669bfe7aeda460af.avif?t=1754826257\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features atmospheric low-resolution pixel art graphics, multiple locations drawn from Venice itself, and developing relationships with NPCs, allowing the player to influence events in the game and achieve multiple different endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928770/extras/9a8b13573f62371b5d9fab6cbb718614.avif?t=1754826257\" width=600 height=296 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by Beyond Booleans, creator of Abscission, winner of three AGS awards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928770/extras/815ec681c52c8676f3ba662d8f2a031f.avif?t=1754826257\" width=600 height=174 /></span></p>",
